# The network libraries of WebKitGTK's stack against mlibc (libxml2,
# libpsl, nghttp2, libsoup 3, glib-networking over LibreSSL), static, for
# WebKitGTK (issue #616): build output in target/libsoup-mlibc-<arch>. A
# library: no app; its smoke is the libsoup-smoke package's (docs/ports.md
# "Cache keys").
PORT_CORE=0
PORT_LIBC=mlibc
PORT_DEPS="mlibc libcxx glib libressl sqlite"
PORT_BUILD=build.sh
PORT_OUTPUTS="libsoup-mlibc-{arch}"
PORT_READY="libsoup-mlibc-{arch}/lib/libsoup-3.0.a"
# What WebKit links but never compiles against: GIO's TLS backend (and so
# LibreSSL). Its key leaves it out (docs/ports.md "Cache keys"); the
# programs linking it key on the whole.
PORT_LINK_OUTPUTS="libsoup-mlibc-{arch}/lib/gio"
PORT_FILES=""
